sp11-sensors: Surface Pro 11 sensors (ADSP SSC over hexagonrpcd + libssc + iio-sensor-proxy)

Data path: ADSP sensors PD <-FastRPC-> hexagonrpcd -s (serves config, identity, registry)
           SSC service <-QMI/QRTR-> libssc -> iio-sensor-proxy -> D-Bus (orientation, light, compass)
           Type Cover tablet switch: SSAM input device, independent of all of the above.

Needs the private tree (Windows-derived, never public): /usr/share/qcom/x1e80100/Microsoft/Surface-Pro-11/
installed by sp11-sensors-install-private.sh from the output of sp11-sensors-stage.sh.

Test (read-only, opt-in): /usr/libexec/sp11/sp11-sensors-test [SECONDS]
Collector: /etc/sp11-log-collector.d/sensors.sh writes extra-sensors.txt.
Preserve existing registry state. Do not stop the daemon, clear the registry, or reset the ADSP as a diagnostic.
